<title>LEBANON: Bank of Lebanon issues CDs worth 74 bln pounds.</title>
<headline>Bank of Lebanon issues CDs worth 74 bln pounds.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lebanon said it issued on Thursday 60-day certificates of deposit dated June 13 to commercial banks, worth 74 billion Lebanese pounds with annual interest of 12.5 percent.</p>
<p>This compared with an issue of 93 billion pounds worth of 60-day CDs at 12.5 percent last week.</p>
<p>For the second successive week, no issue was made in 45-day Cds.</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (9611) 345723 345740 602057</p>
